{"id":"vod_md_6508","vodId":"6508","provider":"md","providerName":"魔都动漫","type":2,"name":"不死不幸","name_cn":"不死不幸","date":"2023-01-01","year":"2023","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"24集全","images":{"common":"https://www.mdzypic.com/upload/vod/20231104-1/4c012bdcb1cfa032ddd17b629387e48b.jpg"},"summary":"出云风子在8岁时，因自己的能力“不幸”造成了一场200人死亡的飞机事故，而她的双亲也在事故中丧生，她自此10年闭门不出。2020年8月，在一直追看的长篇少女漫画连载完结后，她决定自杀。此时她遇见拥有“不死”能力的安迪。安迪凭借其强大的再生能力，即使在风子“不幸”能力的影响下仍能生还。阻止风子自杀后，两人出发寻找让安迪死去的方法。随后，风子发现世上还有其他人拥有类似的异能。能够否定某事物的人被称为“否定者”，亦有由否定者组成的组织“Union”。“Union”的职责为完成“默示录”所给予的任务，例如去讨伐UMA（未确认生物）等，以规避世界再被添加“规则”，然后导致世界灭亡的下场。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"动作,动画,冒险"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2024-03-24 01:43:17","playable":true,"episodeCount":24,"playGroups":[{"name":"modum3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231103/SjXMiqC4/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231103/vNsLG7XM/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231103/bzEK1EX0/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231103/6Wvvbfnj/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231105/688IaJ0r/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231111/ysL9JocV/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231118/e1aemg8f/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231124/jMIDebse/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231202/NfKRZtgB/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231209/mThZSPG8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231216/yyjBVPvy/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231223/bkr1BllN/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20240106/KX99hik3/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20240113/kWyWTPSn/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20240120/qC4TDLcU/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第16集","